807
00:34:07,459 --> 00:34:08,376
We're the heroes.

808
00:34:08,501 --> 00:34:11,958
We're the heroes.

809
00:34:11,959 --> 00:34:13,458
- We're the heroes.
- Get lost.

810
00:34:13,459 --> 00:34:16,084
